<title>PHILIPPINES: RCBC eyes insurance jv with Japanese firm.</title>
<headline>RCBC eyes insurance jv with Japanese firm.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rizal Commercial Banking Corp (RCBC) said on Monday its executive committee had approved a plan to put up a joint venture company with Nippon Life Insurance Corp.</p>
<p>The bank told the Philippine Stock Exchange that it, together with its unit Grepalife, would put in 200 million pesos in equity giving them 50 percent stake in the new insurance company.</p>
<p>The corporation, which will be known as the Philippine Nippon Life Insurance Corp, will be based in Manila.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
</text>
